      "searchCoverage": "Official ClassMarker REST authentication (query api_key + lowercase SHA256(api_key+api_secret+unix_timestamp) + timestamp, 5-minute window), GET /v1.json catalog and recent_results paths, ClassMarker Pty Ltd Sydney identity, and dated incident search (ClassMarker + security breach/incident) reviewed on 2026-09-13. Marker Group / ClassWallet incidents are different companies. Pinned OpenConnector signs every request with sha256Hex. Native templates cannot compute signatures. HTTP 200 with status=error is a false-success that bodyErrorPaths cannot express without treating status=ok as an error. This is not a breach-free claim.",
