    "searchCoverage": "Official ClassMarker REST requires SHA256 query signatures. Pinned executors call sha256Hex(apiKey+apiSecret+timestamp) on every GET. Dated incident search on 2026-09-13 found no qualifying ClassMarker Pty Ltd customer-data compromise after distinguishing Marker Group and ClassWallet. Bounded coverage is not a breach-free claim.",
    "incidents": [],
    "remainingGates": [
      "operationQuality: pinned OpenConnector signs every request with lowercase SHA256(api_key+api_secret+unix_timestamp). Native templates cannot compute signatures. Official docs require the signature and a 5-minute timestamp window.",
      "credentials: unsigned api_key query is not a valid authenticated ClassMarker request. HTTP 200 with status=error cannot be expressed as bodyErrorPaths without treating status=ok as failure.",
      "live authentication unverified"
    ],
    "waiverAuthority": "User waiver dated 2026-09-13 permits historical non-China incident coverage."
  },
